# Project Context

This is the **Oczki Fotografia** marketing site built on:

- **Next.js 16** (Turbopack) with App Router under `src/app/(frontend)`
- **Payload CMS 3.x** under `src/app/(payload)` with collections in `src/collections`
- **Tailwind CSS 4** with `@theme` and CSS custom properties for design tokens
- **TypeScript** strict, `pnpm` as the package manager
- Designs come from Figma (`fileKey: uukPuuZgLMm4kTbXUJFdLI`) via the Figma MCP

## Repo Layout

- `src/app/(frontend)` — public site, layouts, fonts, globals.css
- `src/app/(payload)` — Payload admin UI mount
- `src/collections` — Payload collections (Pages, Posts, Media, Users, Categories)
- `src/blocks` — Payload blocks rendered by `RenderBlocks`
- `src/heros` — Hero variants rendered by `RenderHero`
- `src/components` — UI components; reusable primitives + page-specific sections (e.g. `HomeHero`, `HomeIntro`, `HomeOfferShowcase`)
- `src/fields` — reusable field factories (`link`, `linkGroup`)
- `public/figma` — assets downloaded from Figma (images + SVG)

## Working Style

- Senior-level code: small, composable components, no needless abstraction
- Polish copy in content, English in code, types, comments, commit messages
- Verify with `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` + `ReadLints` after every meaningful edit
- Use TodoWrite for any task with 3+ distinct steps
- Never invent APIs; consult Payload skill at `.claude/skills/payload/SKILL.md`
